From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sapphire <sapphire@local>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] sapphire-0405: Shader pipeline - AIR → NIR → IR3 translation

Complete shader translation pipeline for Adreno 610 (IR3):

1. AIR (Apple Intermediate Representation) → NIR via custom pass
2. NIR → IR3 (freedreno IR3) via nir_to_ir3
3. IR3 → Adreno 610 binary via ir3_compiler

Key challenges:
- MSL 2.2 features not in NIR: argument buffers, function pointers, ray tracing (not supported)
- Metal argument buffers → NIR uniform/storage buffers
- Texture/sampler binding model differences
- Adreno 610 scalar ISA vs vector MSL

This patch adds the translation library and kernel integration.

